l balance Japan GX-A HR-A'', ''A&D Weighing'') that returned Labotal/MRC/Ohaus/Precisa balance pages and unrelated hits. The brand name is hard to search (ampersand) and A&D may be sold in Israel through a weighing/industrial-scale importer rather than a lab distributor, or supplied from abroad; no credible lead was seen. Result: none_found after English, Hebrew-domain and manufacturer-site searches.', '+81 3-5391-6132', NULL, '3-23-14 Higashi-Ikebukuro, Toshima-ku, Tokyo 170-0013, Japan', 'https://aandd.jp/company/contact_us.html', 'https://aandd.jp/company/contact_us.html', 'Q11291617');
