ety trade-fair listing also names Beckman Coulter among the brands Rhenium represents. Diagnostics: no Israeli distributor or office was identified - the search (''Beckman Coulter diagnostics Israel distributor hematology DxH AU analyzer'') returned only regulatory recall records listing Israel among AU5800 distribution countries; the Hebrew query and a beckmancoulter.com domain search were blocked by the search budget and the Diagnostics site could not be opened (fetch failure). The Diagnostics channel therefore remains unverified and may be a different Israeli partner (the brief''s hints Ilex Medical / Dyn Diagnostics were not checked). Agentek appeared in results but shows no Beckman Coulter link.', '+1 714-993-5321', NULL, '250 South Kraemer Boulevard, Brea, CA 92821-6232, USA', 'https://www.beckmancoulter.com/en/support/contact-us', 'https://www.globaldata.com/company-profile/beckman-coulter-inc/locations/', 'Q479952');
