co.il-wide searches. Danyel Biotech is therefore recorded as the Israeli distributor. Esco''s own distributor locator (escolifesciences.com) was not searched within the budget, so Esco''s Medical/pharma-isolator lines may have a different Israeli channel.', '+65 6542 0833', 'mail@escolifesciences.com', '19 Changi South Street 1, Singapore 486777', 'https://www.escolifesciences.com/contact-us', 'https://careers.escolifesciences.com/about-us', 'Q30597519');
