Distributors'' page, but no snippet names an Israeli partner, and no Israeli distributor site returned a Gilson brand page (Ornat''s pipettes category and Tamar''s ''Pipetman-compatible tips'' page appeared, neither evidencing representation). Result: no Israeli entity identified; the manufacturer''s country selector probably lists one but could not be read through search snippets. Agentek''s own vendors page (agentek.co.il/vendors) lists the brand among the manufacturers it represents in Israel (seen in a search excerpt; the manufacturer''s own distributor page was not opened). Lifegene''s own site has Gilson brand and category pages (PIPETMAN Classic/Neo, PLATEMASTER); Agentek''s vendors list also names Gilson, so there appear to be two Israeli channels.', '+1 608-836-1551', NULL, '3000 Parmenter Street, P.O. Box 620027, Middleton, WI 53562-0027, USA', 'https://gmlh.gilson.com/GMLHSV/services-and-support/contact.html', 'https://gmlh.gilson.com/GMLHSV/services-and-support/contact.html', NULL);
