m (page could not be opened). A Sigma-Aldrich Israel catalogue entry for a Hettich item also appeared but is a global catalogue listing, not distribution evidence. Hebrew search ''Hettich צנטריפוגה יבואן ישראל אלדן'' added nothing. Tooling caveat: in this session WebFetch failed with DNS errors on every host, direct HTTPS was policy-blocked by the proxy, and the shared per-turn WebSearch budget ran out before .co.il-restricted and manufacturer-site-restricted searches could run. Steps (b) manufacturer distributor page and (c) Israeli distributor site check were therefore NOT completed; only step (a) searches were done.', '+49 7461 705-0', 'info@hettichlab.com', 'Föhrenstraße 12, 78532 Tuttlingen, Germany', 'https://www.hettichlab.com/contact/', 'https://www.hettichlab.com/imprint', NULL);
