 Israeli distributor. Master-Cold (master-cold.co.il) lists a Ministat 230 and a used Unistat CC and is recorded as a secondary reseller with low confidence. Huber''s own site (huber-online.com) returned only its generic locations/contact pages with no Israel entry visible, and the earlier distributor-domain search found only a Labotal reactor article mentioning Huber in passing.', '+49 781 9603-0', 'info@huber-online.com', 'Werner-von-Siemens-Straße 1, 77656 Offenburg, Germany', 'https://huber-online.com/en/company/locations', 'https://huber-online.com/en/company/locations', NULL);
