n Israel, i.e. the Leica Microsystems medical division. For research microscopes (confocal, stereo, cryo-EM sample prep) the only evidence remains the 2009 Israel Physical Society listing naming Rhenium as exclusive representative; a 2026 search restricted to rhenium.co.il returned nothing, and Leica''s site shows no Israeli office (country selector only, ''contact your local representative''). The research-microscope channel is therefore unconfirmed and the Rhenium entry is stale.', '+49 6441 29-0', NULL, 'Ernst-Leitz-Strasse 17-37, 35578 Wetzlar, Germany', 'https://www.leica-microsystems.com/contact/ideation/', 'https://www.leica-microsystems.com/company/imprint/', 'Q64711880');
