entity. For lab equipment, Mercury Scientific & Industrial Products (part of Gadot since 2022) describes itself as the exclusive Israeli representative for Merck Milli-Q lab-water systems and distributor of Merck KGaA''s life-science and chemicals divisions, so Milli-Q is sold via Mercury rather than direct; this is self-reported on Mercury''s site and not independently confirmed by Merck.', '+972 8 948 4222 / +972 8 948 4100', 'isrcustserv@merckgroup.com', '3 Plaut St., Rehovot 7670603, Israel', 'https://www.sigmaaldrich.com/collections/offices', 'https://www.sigmaaldrich.com/collections/offices', 'Q96472579');
