 Metrohm Middle East FZC (Dubai) is the regional subsidiary for MENA; Israel is not among its listed authorised distributors. Hebrew search and ISI''s own site were not checked (search budget exhausted).', '+41 71 353 85 85', 'info@metrohm.com', 'Ionenstrasse, 9100 Herisau, Switzerland', 'https://www.metrohm.com/en/company/how-to-find-us.html', 'https://www.metrohm.com/en/Company-info.html', 'Q1925733');
