ndependently confirms it with a Mettler Toledo representative page, a news item that it distributes Mettler-Toledo Rainin pipettes, and balance/titration/scale product pages. No Mettler-Toledo Israeli subsidiary was found; phone numbers and the exact scope split were taken from search snippets and not re-checked on the live page. Agentek''s own vendors page (agentek.co.il/vendors) lists the brand among the manufacturers it represents in Israel (seen in a search excerpt; the manufacturer''s own distributor page was not opened).', '+1 614-438-4511', NULL, '1900 Polaris Parkway, Columbus, OH 43240, USA', NULL, 'https://s202.q4cdn.com/258391627/files/doc_financials/2014-Annual-Report.pdf', 'Q680186');
