), ceramic kilns, tube furnaces and the B400/C440/P470 controller documentation. Both the manufacturer''s locator and the distributor''s site therefore agree; the earlier round-1 locator snippet simply had not shown the Israel entry.', '+49 4298 922-0', 'contact@nabertherm.de', 'Bahnhofstraße 20, 28865 Lilienthal, Germany', 'https://nabertherm.com/en/contact/world-wide-sales', 'https://nabertherm.com/en/downloads/service-instructions', NULL);
