, objectives). Nikon''s corporate global-network page assigns Israel (biological and industrial microscopes) to Nikon Europe B.V., i.e. the regional subsidiary serves Israel through the local dealer Agentek. Both sides of the relationship are documented. Agentek''s own vendors page (agentek.co.il/vendors) lists the brand among the manufacturers it represents in Israel (seen in a search excerpt; the manufacturer''s own distributor page was not opened).', '+81 3 3773 1111', 'Bsmarketing.Sales@nikon.com', '1-5-20 Nishi-Oi, Shinagawa-ku, Tokyo 140-8601, Japan', 'https://www.healthcare.nikon.com/en/contact', 'https://www.nikon.com/company/sustainability/report/2025/sr2025_03.pdf', 'Q1218180');
