r sweep returned only Quantum Design pages. Nothing credible found after four angles: the brand restricted to 43 Israeli distributor domains, a Hebrew importer/representative query, a search restricted to oxinst.com / andor.oxinst.com / nano.oxinst.com (Israel appears only as a country option in the Andor, Imaris and WITec contact forms; the WITec page says to contact HQ where no official representative exists), and an Israeli sole-supplier (ספק יחיד) tender query. No source seen names an Israeli distributor for Andor cameras, NanoAnalysis EDS/EBSD or WITec Raman; the Israeli channel may be direct from the UK/EU or via a company outside the domain list. Status remains none_found.', '+44 1865 393200', NULL, 'Tubney Woods, Abingdon, Oxfordshire OX13 5QX, UK', 'https://www.oxinst.com/contact-us', 'https://www.sharecast.com/scroll_3/equity/Oxford_Instruments/profile', NULL);
