va) as an Israeli partner for food testing. After the 2023 split the Israel entity stayed with the analytical company (now New Mountain Capital-owned PerkinElmer) rather than Revvity; no 2024-2026 Israel-specific news was found, so current staffing/scope of the Ra''anana office rests on the manufacturer''s current listing only.', '1700-500-512 (Israel domestic number)', 'cc.israel@perkinelmer.com', 'Shelton, Connecticut', 'https://www.perkinelmer.com/contactus/requestaquote.html', 'https://ir.revvity.com/news/investor-news/news-details/2013/PerkinElmer-Establishes-Direct-Operations-in-Israel-08-01-2013/default.aspx', 'Q2066858');
