 Europe but Israel was not visible, and it states it is not recruiting new distributors. Lumitron''s own ''Our brands'' page lists PHCbi among the brands it distributes in Israel (seen in a search excerpt).', '+81 3 5408 7280', NULL, '15F Dai-ichi Life Hibiya First, 1-13-2 Yurakucho, Chiyoda-ku, Tokyo 100-8403, Japan', 'https://www.phchd.com/global/forms/Input?form_id=%7BA1E4FD0D-9F27-4C4D-9FD1-7A057C9FE770%7D', 'https://www.phchd.com/global/news/2024/0315', NULL);
