R ''Verder Scientific'' Israel distributor/נציג/יבואן) found no Israeli entity (only Verder Scientific South Africa and US pages). Domain-restricted search found multiple mrclab.com pages selling Carbolite Gero ovens/furnaces; nothing surfaced for Retsch, Eltra, Microtrac or QATM on the Israeli distributor domains. Whether MRC is the official Carbolite Gero distributor or a reseller is not stated in the snippet; Verder''s regional contact pages were not fetched.', '+49 2104 2333-500', 'info@verder-scientific.com', 'Retsch-Allee 1-5, 42781 Haan, Germany', 'https://www.verder-scientific.com/contact', 'https://www.verder-scientific.com/contact', 'Q124545143');
