(fetch blocked) and the Hebrew query ''טקאן Tecan ישראל נציג יבואן'' and the ''Tecan Israel partner Gamidor/Eldan/Rhenium'' query were blocked by the exhausted budget. Gamidor Diagnostics appears in the brief''s list of known Israeli diagnostics distributors. The channel for Tecan''s life-science automation (Fluent/Freedom EVO/Spark) in Israel remains unestablished. Tool limits in this session: the shared web-search budget was exhausted after the first round of searches and all page fetches (WebFetch/curl) were blocked, so manufacturer distributor/contact pages could not be opened and some Hebrew searches could not be run. Size figures marked ''recalled'' come from company filings/pages as known to the researcher (knowledge to mid-2026) and were not re-verified against a fetched source.', '+41 44 922 81 11', 'info@tecan.com', 'Seestrasse 103, 8708 Männedorf, Switzerland', 'https://www.tecan.com/contact-us', 'https://www.tecanannualreport.com/annual-report-2022/global', 'Q2398881');
