search-result evidence only (WebFetch and curl were blocked by the environment''s network policy, so manufacturer and distributor pages could not be opened). Searches run: ''"Thermo Fisher" Israel distributor'', ''"Thermo Fisher Scientific" Israel office Ltd'', ''"Thermo Fisher" ישראל נציג יבואן'', ''Rhenium Thermo Scientific Israel distributor'', ''Invitrogen Applied Biosystems Gibco Israel distributor'', ''"Thermo Fisher Integrated Solutions Israel"'', ''Bargal Analytical Instruments ... Thermo Scientific''. Picture: Thermo Fisher has its OWN Israeli presence (Thermo Fisher Israel Ltd. site in Kiryat Shmona with Israeli ISO certificates; an EM service location in Airport City, Lod; and a newly formed ''Thermo Fisher Integrated Solutions Israel'' subsidiary in Ra''anana that is hiring key-account managers and building a field-service team - i.e. a move toward direct sales for life-science products), PLUS division-specific Israeli distributors: Gamidor Diagnostics (non-exclusive distributor letter valid to Mar 2026, likely diagnostics/microbiology), Danyel Biotech (Olink), Rhenium (Life Technologies brands since 2011 - stale, may have been superseded by the new direct subsidiary) and Bargal (chromatography, 2018-2019 letter - stale). Fisher Scientific channel / Phadia (ImmunoCAP) / Thermo Scientific lab-equipment distributors in Israel were NOT established (the Phadia-locations page exists but could not be read). The exact registered names of the Israeli entities are unconfirmed (job ads say ''Thermo Fisher Integrated Solutions Israel'' / ''...Integrated Solutions Ltd'').', '+972 73 256 0860', NULL, 'Waltham, Massachusetts', 'https://www.thermofisher.com/store/v2/contact-us?enableChat=true', 'https://slimpages.startupim.com/company_page/thermo-fisher-scientific', NULL);
