sraeli channel, which was not found. velp.com was not checked (search budget).', '+39 039 628811', NULL, 'Via Stazione 16, 20865 Usmate (MB), Italy', 'https://velp.com/en-ww/where-we-are.aspx', 'https://velp.com/en-ww/where-we-are.aspx', NULL);
